{"id":"862f59a105f9b934","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-thm-iterated-ultrapower-limit.md","title":"Iterated Ultrapower Limit","display":"thm-iterated-ultrapower-limit — Iterated Ultrapower Limit","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-iterated-ultrapower-limit","aliases":["58-thm-iterated-ultrapower-limit"],"display":"thm-iterated-ultrapower-limit — Iterated Ultrapower Limit","depends_on":["[[58-df-ultrapower]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]","[[58-df-wellfounded]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-bijective]]","[[58-df-transitive]]","[[58-df-direct-limit]]","[[58-df-limitordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-iterated-ultrapower-limit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-iterated-ultrapower-limit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-iterated-ultrapower-limit — Iterated Ultrapower Limit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"80d22bbd3f726e33\" href=\"?note=80d22bbd3f726e33\" title=\"58-df-ultrapower\">58-df-ultrapower</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"58-df-equivalence-relation\">58-df-equivalence-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7308daa58e0345ed\" href=\"?note=7308daa58e0345ed\" title=\"58-df-wellfounded\">58-df-wellfounded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"58-df-transitive\">58-df-transitive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3a9f5d3a8e080215\" href=\"?note=3a9f5d3a8e080215\" title=\"58-df-direct-limit\">58-df-direct-limit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,\\vec M,\\vec j,M_\\delta,\\vec j_\\delta\\in V\">\\(\\delta,\\vec M,\\vec j,M_\\delta,\\vec j_\\delta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transitive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Transitive}\\)</span> are the registered set-level predicates used to build and collapse each ultrapower</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S\\)</span> are the exact predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3a9f5d3a8e080215\" href=\"?note=3a9f5d3a8e080215\" title=\"58-df-direct-limit\">58-df-direct-limit</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltrapowerMembershipStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UltrapowerMembershipStructure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellFoundedUltrapowerStep}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WellFoundedUltrapowerStep}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltrapowerIterationSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UltrapowerIterationSystem}_S\\)</span> are defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}membership\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerMembershipStructure}_S(Q,E,R;M,U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land R=\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in(M^\\kappa)^2:\\{i\\in\\kappa:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,M^\\kappa)\n\\land Q=(M^\\kappa)/R\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land E=\\Bigl\\{\\langle[f]_R,[g]_R\\rangle\\in Q^2:\nf,g\\in M^\\kappa\\land\\{i\\in\\kappa:f(i)\\in g(i)\\}\\in U\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}membership\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerMembershipStructure}_S(Q,E,R;M,U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land R=\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in(M^\\kappa)^2:\\{i\\in\\kappa:f(i)=g(i)\\}\\in U\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,M^\\kappa)\n\\land Q=(M^\\kappa)/R\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land E=\\Bigl\\{\\langle[f]_R,[g]_R\\rangle\\in Q^2:\nf,g\\in M^\\kappa\\land\\{i\\in\\kappa:f(i)\\in g(i)\\}\\in U\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}step}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WellFoundedUltrapowerStep}_S(N,j;M,U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\exists Q,E,R,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerMembershipStructure}_S(Q,E,R;M,U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{WF}(E,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(N)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,Q,N)\n\\land\\forall u,v\\in Q\\;\\bigl(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\pi(u)\\in\\pi(v)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,M,N)\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists f\\in M^\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall i\\in\\kappa\\;(f(i)=x)\n\\land j(x)=\\pi([f]_R)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}step}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WellFoundedUltrapowerStep}_S(N,j;M,U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\exists Q,E,R,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerMembershipStructure}_S(Q,E,R;M,U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{WF}(E,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\mathrm{Transitive}(N)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,Q,N)\n\\land\\forall u,v\\in Q\\;\\bigl(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\pi(u)\\in\\pi(v)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,M,N)\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists f\\in M^\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall i\\in\\kappa\\;(f(i)=x)\n\\land j(x)=\\pi([f]_R)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerIterationSystem}_S(\\vec M,\\vec j,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\delta\\neq0\n\\land\\exists R_\\delta,\\vec\\kappa,\\vec U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_\\delta=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\delta^2:\\alpha\\subseteq\\beta\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec j,R_\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec j))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\kappa,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\kappa))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec U,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec U))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S(\\vec M,\\vec j,\\delta,R_\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{WellFoundedUltrapowerStep}_S\\!\\left(\n\\vec M(\\alpha+1),\\vec j(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha+1\\rangle);\n\\vec M(\\alpha),\\vec U(\\alpha),\\vec\\kappa(\\alpha)\n\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerIterationSystem}_S(\\vec M,\\vec j,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\delta\\neq0\n\\land\\exists R_\\delta,\\vec\\kappa,\\vec U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nR_\\delta=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\delta^2:\\alpha\\subseteq\\beta\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec j,R_\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec j))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\kappa,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\kappa))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec U,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec U))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S(\\vec M,\\vec j,\\delta,R_\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{WellFoundedUltrapowerStep}_S\\!\\left(\n\\vec M(\\alpha+1),\\vec j(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha+1\\rangle);\n\\vec M(\\alpha),\\vec U(\\alpha),\\vec\\kappa(\\alpha)\n\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{UltrapowerIterationSystem}_S(\\vec M,\\vec j,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\longrightarrow\n\\exists M_\\delta,\\vec j_\\delta\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S\\!\\left(\nM_\\delta,\\vec j_\\delta,\\vec M,\\vec j,\\delta,\n\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\delta^2:\\alpha\\subseteq\\beta\\}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}limit}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{UltrapowerIterationSystem}_S(\\vec M,\\vec j,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\longrightarrow\n\\exists M_\\delta,\\vec j_\\delta\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S\\!\\left(\nM_\\delta,\\vec j_\\delta,\\vec M,\\vec j,\\delta,\n\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\delta^2:\\alpha\\subseteq\\beta\\}\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each successor step now supplies its ultrafilter, quotient membership relation, well-foundedness witness, Mostowski collapse, and constant-function embedding; the former iteration predicate had no definition or ultrafilter data.</li>\n<li>The index relation is ordinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> (coded by inclusion), not strict membership.  This makes it reflexive as required by the registered directed-system predicate.</li>\n<li>A direct limit need not literally be the union of the earlier models; it is formed from coherent equivalence classes.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ultrapower","status":"resolved","id":"80d22bbd3f726e33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrapower]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-wellfounded","status":"resolved","id":"7308daa58e0345ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-wellfounded]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-direct-limit","status":"resolved","id":"3a9f5d3a8e080215","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-direct-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-limitordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-direct-limit","status":"resolved","id":"3a9f5d3a8e080215","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirectSystem}_S$ and $\\mathrm{DirectLimit}_S$ are the exact predicates from [[58-df-direct-limit]]","emb